# Code-Equalize — Cursor Rules

# Phase 1 | May 2026

---

## Project Overview

Code-Equalize is a VS Code extension that explains programming errors in Kannada or Hindi using a RAG pipeline backed by ChromaDB and OpenAI GPT-4o-mini.

---

## Tech Stack (Strict — Do Not Deviate)

### Backend

* Runtime: Node.js
* Framework: Express.js
* Language: JavaScript only (NO TypeScript in backend)
* Vector DB: ChromaDB (local, port 8000)
* AI Model: OpenAI GPT-4o-mini
* Embeddings: OpenAI text-embedding-3-small
* HTTP Client: axios

### Extension

* Language: TypeScript
* Framework: VS Code Extension API
* No frontend frameworks (no React, no Vue)

---

## Development Mode (Important)

* First implement a mock RAG pipeline (no real ChromaDB or OpenAI)
* Use in-memory arrays for database
* Use dummy responses for AI
* After full flow works → integrate real services
* Mock responses must match the exact API contract shape

---

